sur PC-DIR-02</h1><p>Serveur web du simulateur.</p></body></html>"}}},"mgmt":{"comms":[],"location":"","contact":"","syslogd":false,"trapd":false},"v6":{"ifs":[{"name":"Ethernet0","autoconf":true,"addrs":[]}],"statics":[]},"label":""}],"links":[{"a":["D5","Ethernet0"],"b":["D3","FastEthernet0/1"],"type":"straight"},{"a":["D6","Ethernet0"],"b":["D3","FastEthernet0/2"],"type":"straight"},{"a":["D7","Ethernet0"],"b":["D4","FastEthernet0/1"],"type":"straight"},{"a":["D8","Ethernet0"],"b":["D4","FastEthernet0/2"],"type":"straight"},{"a":["D3","FastEthernet0/24"],"b":["D1","GigabitEthernet0/0"],"type":"straight"},{"a":["D4","FastEthernet0/24"],"b":["D2","GigabitEthernet0/0"],"type":"straight"},{"a":["D1","GigabitEthernet0/1"],"b":["D2","GigabitEthernet0/1"],"type":"cross"}],"notes":"","tpfile":{"v":1,"id":"cours-s07-routage-statique","type":"decouverte","diff":2,"cat":"Cours BTS SIO — S07","level":"BTS SIO SISR 1re année — Bloc 2 — S07","duration":"1 h","title":"S07 — Deux réseaux reliés par un routeur : routes statiques","desc":"Les réseaux Informatique (192.168.10.0/24) et Direction (192.168.20.0/24) sont reliés par une liaison WAN 10.0.0.0/30 : configurer les interfaces des deux routeurs et les routes statiques.","objectives":["Adresser les interfaces LAN et WAN des routeurs","Écrire une route statique vers un réseau distant","Lire la table de routage (codes C et S) et valider la connectivité inter-réseaux"],"steps":["Le plan est câblé et les PC sont adressés (passerelles .1). La liaison WAN utilise ici le port <code>gi0/1</code> des deux routeurs (le simulateur n'a pas de port série ; sur matériel, c'est <code>Se0/0/0</code>). Anticipez : <code>PC-INFO-01</code> joint-il <code>PC-DIR-01</code> avant toute configuration ?","Sur <b>R1_INFO</b> : <code>gi0/0</code> en <code>192.168.10.1/24</code>, <code>gi0/1</code> (WAN) en <code>10.0.0.1/30</code>, <code>no shutdown</code> sur les deux, <code>description</code> sur chacune.","Sur <b>R2_DIR</b> : <code>gi0/0</code> en <code>192.168.20.1/24</code>, <code>gi0/1</code> (WAN) en <code>10.0.0.2/30</code>, <code>no shutdown</code>.","Vérifiez avec <code>show ip interface brief</code> et <code>show ip route</code> : seules les routes connectées (code C) apparaissent. Testez : <code>ping 10.0.0.2</code> depuis R1 fonctionne, mais un PC ne joint pas l'autre réseau.","Ajoutez les routes statiques : sur R1, <code>ip route 192.168.20.0 255.255.255.0 10.0.0.2</code> ; sur R2, <code>ip route 192.168.10.0 255.255.255.0 10.0.0.1</code>. Relisez <code>show ip route</code> (code S).","Testez de bout en bout puis cliquez sur « Vérifier mon travail ». Dans l'analyseur, observez le TTL d'un ping qui traverse les deux routeurs."],"checks":[{"t":"cli","label":"R1_INFO : interfaces gi0/0 et gi0/1 configurées et actives","dev":"R1_INFO","cmd":"show ip interface brief","match":"GigabitEthernet0/0\\s+192\\.168\\.10\\.1\\s.*up\\s+up\\s*\\nGigabitEthernet0/1\\s+10\\.0\\.0\\.1\\s.*up\\s+up"},{"t":"cli","label":"R2_DIR : interfaces gi0/0 et gi0/1 configurées et actives","dev":"R2_DIR","cmd":"show ip interface brief","match":"GigabitEthernet0/0\\s+192\\.168\\.20\\.1\\s.*up\\s+up\\s*\\nGigabitEthernet0/1\\s+10\\.0\\.0\\.2\\s.*up\\s+up"},{"t":"cli","label":"R1_INFO : route statique vers 192.168.20.0/24 via 10.0.0.2","dev":"R1_INFO","cmd":"show ip route","match":"S\\s+192\\.168\\.20\\.0/24.*10\\.0\\.0\\.2"},{"t":"cli","label":"R2_DIR : route statique vers 192.168.10.0/24 via 10.0.0.1","dev":"R2_DIR","cmd":"show ip route","match":"S\\s+192\\.168\\.10\\.0/24.*10\\.0\\.0\\.1"},{"t":"ping","label":"R1_INFO joint R2_DIR sur le lien WAN","from":"R1_INFO","to":"10.0.0.2"},{"t":"ping","label":"PC-INFO-01 joint PC-DIR-01","from":"PC-INFO-01","to":"192.168.20.11"},{"t":"ping","label":"PC-DIR-02 joint PC-INFO-02","from":"PC-DIR-02","to":"192.168.10.12"}],"solution":{"app":"simulateur-reseau","v":1,"opts":{"strictCables":false,"stpFast":true},"devices":[{"id":"D1","type":"router","model":"r-1941","name":"R1_INFO","x":200,"y":250,"powered":true,"cli":"!\nhostname R1_INFO\n!\ninterface GigabitEthernet0/0\n description LAN Informatique 192.168.10.0/24\n ip address 192.168.10.1 255.255.255.0\n!\ninterface GigabitEthernet0/1\n description WAN vers R2_DIR\n ip address 10.0.0.1 255.255.255.252\n!\nip route 192.168.20.0 255.255.255.0 10.0.0.2\n!\nline con 0\n logging synchronous\nline vty 0 4\n!","label":""},{"id":"D2","type":"router","model":"r-1941","name":"R2_DIR","x":600,"y":250,"powered":true,"cli":"!\nhostname R2_DIR\n!\ninterface GigabitEthernet0/0\n description LAN Direction 192.168.20.0/24\n ip address 192.168.20.1 255.255.255.0\n!\ninterface GigabitEthernet0/1\n description WAN vers R1_INFO\n ip address 10.0.0.2 255.255.255.252\n!\nip route 192.168.10.0 255.255.255.0 10.0.0.1\n!\nline con 0\n logging synchronous\nline vty 0 4\n!","label":""},{"id":"D3","type":"switch","model":"sw-2960","name":"SW-INFO","x":200,"y":130,"powered":true,"cli":"!\nhostname SW-INFO\n!\nspanning-tree mode pvst\nline con 0\n logging synchronous\nline vty 0 4\n!","label":""},{"id":"D4","type":"switch","model":"sw-2960","name":"SW-DIR","x":600,"y":130,"powered":true,"cli":"!\nhostname SW-DIR\n!\nspanning-tree mode pvst\nline con 0\n logging synchronous\nline vty 0 4\n!","label":""},{"id":"D5","type":"pc","model":"pc-win","name":"PC-INFO-01","x":100,"y":20,"powered":true,"ifaces":[{"name":"Ethernet0","ip":"192.168.10.11","mask":"255.255.255.0","dhcp":false}],"gw":"192.168.10.1","dns":[],"domain":"","allowIcmpEcho":true,"wifi":{"ssid":"","key":""},"hosts":{},"dhcpd":{"enabled":false,"excluded":[],"pools":[]},"dnsd":{"enabled":false,"records":[],"forwarders":[]},"httpd":{"enabled":false,"https":false,"pages":{"/":{"type":"text/html; charset=utf-8","body":"<html><head><title>PC-INFO-01</title></head><body><h1>Bienvenue sur PC-INFO-01</h1><p>Serveur web du simulateur.</p></body></html>"}}},"mgmt":{"comms":[],"location":"","contact":"","syslogd":false,"trapd":false},"v6":{"ifs":[{"name":"Ethernet0","autoconf":true,"ad